Purpose: Automatically re-wields disarmed weapons by mapping item names to aliases.

/enchant.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automates enchanting loops with item tracking and spell casting.

/gourd.plugin.ts
Purpose: Tracks and manages potion gourd inventory with scan, quaff, and drop commands.

/highlighter.plugin.ts
Purpose: Highlights player names by organization in configurable trigger lines.

/people.plugin.ts
Purpose: Parses player data from game commands into a shared database for tagging and filtering.

/peopleDb.ts
Purpose: Manages persistent storage and retrieval of character data for the game client.

/questbot-stats-idb.ts
Purpose: IndexedDB storage for QuestBot statistics with bounded session and aggregate records.

/questbot.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automates DSL questing cycles with stats tracking and command interfaces.

/respell.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically recasts configured spells when their effects drop in the game.

/roller.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically accepts or rejects stat rolls based on configurable thresholds and prompts.

/standup.plugin.ts
Purpose: Automatically stands up the player when game messages match configured knockdown patterns.

/warlock-alphabet.plugin.ts
Purpose: This plugin helps warlocks manage spell recipes by tracking item assignments to brew letters and automating correct insertion order.
